- NATIVE WINDOWS: a push-free exact-byte snapshot on `ssh win` matched the local two-file overlay and pinned rc.5 archive hashes. Focused pytest exited 0 with 131 passed / 10 skips, and full pytest exited 0 with 1064 passed / 116 skips. The task-owned remote root and staging inputs were removed and absence verified.
- HOST GATES: final macOS focused pytest exited 0 with 141 passed; full pytest exited 0 with 1159 passed / 21 skips; the wheel-installed native Go 1.25.5 fixture exited 0 with 10 passed. Configured and Linux-target strict mypy passed 65 files; unsupported-Linux focused selection passed 129 / skipped 12; build, Twine, compileall, tabnanny, and diff hygiene exited 0.
- QUALIFICATION BOUNDARY: `ssh lev` timed out with exit 255 and no local Linux container runtime was available, so no native Linux full-suite claim is made. The invalid whole-suite Darwin kernel emulation and every iterative non-zero gate remain recorded as failures in `TASK-260720-2g21eg_cycle6-ci-portability-rework.md`.

