+| `.venv/bin/python -m build` | 0 | sdist and wheel built |
+| `.venv/bin/python -m twine check dist/*` | 0 | sdist and wheel passed |
+| `git diff --check` | 0 | Passed |
+| `test ! -e uv.lock` | 0 | Passed |
